msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:93
msgid "The next song in the Auto DJ cue is skipped"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:94
msgid "Up / Down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:96
msgid ""
"Moves up and down in the library track list. If held down and any of the jog"
" wheels is moved, then the jog wheel takes over the cursor movement until "
"the up/down button is released"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:97
msgid "Cue/Mix"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:99
msgid "Control mix of main and PFL (cue) output in headphones"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:100
msgid "Mic On/Off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:102
msgid ""
"Enables or disables the microphone. The microphone is always mixed in "
"hardware. The trayicon driver configuration allows to choose between direct "
"mixing, or mix it only when enabled with the button. It no longer tries to "
"activate Mixxx microphone talkover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:105
msgid ""
"Note: The Microphone volume and the Headphone volume controls are hardware "
"controls (i.e. they don’t control Mixxx’s interface)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:107
msgid "Deck / Channel specific controls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:115
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:118
msgid "Shift key"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:117
msgid ""
"When this button is pressed and released, it toggles between keypad "
"functions 1-6 to keypad functions 7-12. When keypad functions 7-12 are "
"active, the shift button is lit orange."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:120
msgid ""
"When this button is pressed and released, it toggles between keypad "
"functions 1-6 to k Hold it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:121
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:124
