#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:126
msgid ""
"Play backwards. If slip mode is enabled (triangle image in Deere skin), it "
"will resume beyond the previous position (i.e. the playback continues muted "
"until the button is released)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:127
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:130
msgid "Stop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:129
msgid ""
"Moves the cursor to the beginning, or to the cue point if it is set, and "
"stops playing it, if it was playing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:132
msgid ""
"Brake (Slow it down progressively). Releasing it will continue playing, "
"except if it has slowed a lot, in which case it stops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:133
msgid "Cue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:135
msgid "Depends on the cue mode set in Mixxx preferences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:136
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:139
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:142
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:145
msgid "Jog wheel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:138
msgid ""
"Seeks forwards and backwards in a stopped track Temporarily changes the "
"playback speed for playing tracks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:140
msgid "Scratch on and jog pressed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:141
msgid ""
"If Scratch is on and the jog is pressed, moving it will do a scratch effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:143
msgid "Up/Down pressed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:144
msgid "Moves up / down in the tracklist if either Up or Down are held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:146
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:164
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:203
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:218
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:239
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:245
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:278
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:287
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:296
msgid "LED"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:147
msgid ""
"If the beatflash led has been set to jogwheel in the JavaScript file, the "
"light of this button will be flashing following the beats of the song."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:148
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:151
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:154
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:157
msgid "Forward / Backward"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:150
msgid "Seeks at high speed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:153
msgid ""
"Seeks forward or backward in the track in steps of 4 beats (when the "
"beatgrid has already been detected)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:155
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:167
msgid "Pressed for 500ms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:156
msgid "seeks at high speed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:159
msgid "Seeks forward or backward in the track in steps of 1 beats"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:160
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:163
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:166
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:169
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:172
msgid "Sync"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:162
msgid ""
"Automatically sets the pitch fader speed to match the BPM of the other deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:165
msgid ""
"If the beatflash led has been set to Sync in the JavaScript file, the light "
"of this button will be flashing following the beats of the song."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:168
msgid "Activates sync lock for this deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:171
msgid "Activates the beatgrid edit mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:173
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:182
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:191
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:320
msgid "Beatgrid edit mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:174
msgid ""
"When the track is stopped, aligns the beatgrid with the current playback "
"position. If playing, synchronizes the beatgrid to align with that of the "
"other playing track."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:175
msgid "Pitch fader"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:177
msgid ""
"Adjusts playback speed (range and direction can be adjusted in Mixxx "
"preferences)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:178
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:181
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:184
msgid "Pitch bend +/-"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:180
msgid ""
"Adjusts playback speed temporarily (range can be adjusted in Mixxx "
"preferences)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:183
msgid "Increases or decreases the BPM of the track (the detected one)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:186
msgid ""
"Adjust playback speed permanently (range can be adjusted in Mixxx "
"preferences)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:187
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:190
msgid "Pitch Scale +/-"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:189
msgid ""
"These controls have a different meaning in Mixxx: They have been mapped to "
"change the musical key"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:192
msgid "Move the beatgrid to the left or to the right"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:193
msgid "Pitch Scale -"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:195
msgid "Activates or deactivates the (musical) keylock mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:196
msgid "Pitch Scale +"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:198
msgid "Activates or deactivates the quantize (to beat) mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:199
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:202
msgid "Pitch Reset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:201
msgid ""
"This is triggered when both pitch scale buttons are pressed at the same "
"time. This control has a different meaning in Mixxx: It resets the musical "
"key to the track’s default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:204
msgid ""
"This led has a different meaning in Mixxx: If the beatflash led has been set"
" to pitchreset in the JavaScript file, the light of this button will be "
"flashing following the beats of the song. Else, the led is on if the key "
"lock button is enabled for this deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:205
msgid "Deck A/C, B/D"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:207
msgid ""
"Switches the deck to control between Deck A/C or between Deck B/D. Lights "
"are changed accordingly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:208
msgid "Vol. Deck"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:210
msgid "Controls a deck’s output volume"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:211
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:214
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:217
msgid "Cue Select Deck"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_4_mx.md:213
msgid ""
"Toggles on and off this deck’s output to the monitor/prefader listen "
"(headphones) By default, it is configured in the JavaScript to activate it "
